# Per-repo configuration schema version of this source tree (#9292).
# `fullsend repos` reads this file at a repository's pinned fullsend_ref to
# render .fullsend/config.yaml in the shape that ref reads. Increment it, and
# config.ManagedConfigSchemaVersion with a renderer for the previous version,
# whenever a per-repo configuration change is not readable by older releases.
#
# groups_from and accounts_from (#9132) did not increment it, although older
# releases reject them: install and status refuse them for an older ref with
# checkJiraAuthorizationEnvSupport (internal/repos/jira_poll.go). A new
# version would make older CLIs refuse every pinned repository that sets
# tracker, and would refuse vendored installs, which support the keys.
